# lexicon.src - English labels pointing at concepts.
#   label | pos | ^concept | feats (k=v;k=v, ^ = concept reference)
# A label may point at several concepts; a concept may have several labels.
# The first label listed for a concept+form is the one the realiser uses.
#
# --- default concept for a name the lexicon does not know ---
*name|name|^living|
*clock|clock|^time-point|
# classes the testimony assessor asks about, by concept, never by word
*place|placeclass|^place|
*building|buildingclass|^building|
*crime|crimeclass|^crime|
*move|moveclass|^move|
# compass directions: one slot, so the northeast pylon is never the northwest pylon
north|adj|^north-dir|
northern|adj|^north-dir|
northerly|adj|^north-dir|
north|noun|^north-dir|
south|adj|^south-dir|
southern|adj|^south-dir|
southerly|adj|^south-dir|
south|noun|^south-dir|
east|adj|^east-dir|
eastern|adj|^east-dir|
easterly|adj|^east-dir|
east|noun|^east-dir|
west|adj|^west-dir|
western|adj|^west-dir|
westerly|adj|^west-dir|
west|noun|^west-dir|
northeast|adj|^northeast-dir|
northeastern|adj|^northeast-dir|
northeasterly|adj|^northeast-dir|
northeast|noun|^northeast-dir|
northwest|adj|^northwest-dir|
northwestern|adj|^northwest-dir|
northwesterly|adj|^northwest-dir|
northwest|noun|^northwest-dir|
southeast|adj|^southeast-dir|
southeastern|adj|^southeast-dir|
