southwest|adj|^southwest-dir|
southwestern|adj|^southwest-dir|
southwesterly|adj|^southwest-dir|
southwest|noun|^southwest-dir|
# slots: two different values of one slot are two different things
*slot|slotclass|^colour|
*slot|slotclass|^size|
*slot|slotclass|^brightness|
*slot|slotclass|^height|
*slot|slotclass|^compass-direction|
*female|genderclass|^female-person|gender=f
*male|genderclass|^male-person|gender=m
# --- section headings that make a source of what follows ---
statement|section|-|tier=TESTIMONY
testimony|section|-|tier=TESTIMONY
record|section|-|tier=DOCUMENTARY
order|section|-|mode=order
message|section|-|mode=order
*see|seeclass|^see|
*command|commandclass|^command|
commanded|verb|^command|form=past
commands|verb|^command|form=pres
command|verb|^command|form=base
*event|eventclass|^event|
