# --- phrasal verbs: ^verb+word -> concept. pp=patient: the PP's object
#     becomes the patient. pp=keep: the word is the PP's own preposition.
^pick+up|phrasal|^lift|
^set+down|phrasal|^set|
^put+down|phrasal|^put|
^look+at|phrasal|^look-at|pp=patient
^call+out|phrasal|^call-out|
^call+back|phrasal|^reply|
^get+off|phrasal|^leave|pp=keep
^run+down|phrasal|^descend|pp=keep
